<title>USA: Superior Industries raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Superior Industries raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Industries International Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.07 per share from $0.06.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on July 18 to shareholders of record July 3.</p>
</text>
